# FastEndpoints REPR Rules

- Each HTTP endpoint resides in `Endpoints/{Feature}/{Action}Endpoint.cs`.
- Place Request, Response, Validator, and Endpoint in the same file or a cohesive feature folder.
- Inherit from `Endpoint<TRequest, TResponse>` or `EndpointWithoutRequest<TResponse>`.
- Use `Configure()` to set HTTP route, method, and Swagger metadata.
- Use `await Send.OkAsync(...)`, `await Send.CreatedAtAsync(...)`, `await Send.NotFoundAsync(...)`, etc.
- Always validate input with `Validator<TRequest>`.
